{c: Chords: the writer's own chart}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Am]He was conceived by the Spirit,
[Dm]A miraculous birth
[G]He came down from heaven
[C]To live [E]amongst us
[Am]He knew His faith
[Dm]When He prayed on that hill
[G]As His sweat turned to blood,
[E]Facing death He was still
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[Am]Oh Emmanuel
[F]Oh Emmanuel
[G]The Prince of Peace
[G]The King of kings
[C]The Great I [E]Am
[Am]Oh Emmanuel
[F]Oh Emmanuel
[G]The Prince of Peace
[G]The King of kings
[C]The Great I [E]Am
[Am]Oh Emmanuel
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Am]In the beginning was the Word
[Dm]And the Word was our God
[G]The triumphant King
[C]Who reigns [E]over all
[Am]He knew no sin
[Dm]Yet He laid down His life
[G]As He hung on the cross
[E]We are healed by His stripes
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
[F]Jesus sits on His throne
[G]Every eye will behold
[Am]When He comes amongst the clouds
[F]Every tongue will confess
[G]Every knee will bow down
[Am]To the glory of His name
[Dm]To the glory [E]of His name
{end_of_bridge}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Tag}
[E]Oh [Am]Emmanuel
[E]Oh [Am]Emmanuel
{end_of_verse}
